# HUD 해부도의 바탕 캡처: vhs docs/demo/hud.tape → docs/demo/hud-raw.mp4 → 마지막 프레임 (docs/demo/annotate_hud.py 가 번호표를 덧그린다)
Output "docs/demo/hud-raw.mp4"
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 2640
Set Height 330
Set Padding 40
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "source docs/demo/env.zsh && PROMPT='' && clear && COLUMNS=150 hud high" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 500ms
Sleep 1s
